    {
        "text": "Ugh, my tail's all wet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing's changed at all. Neither these filthy streets, nor this damned rain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dunno what it is, but even though the snow in Ursus can kill people, the rain here's somehow more unpleasant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hope there's a hairdryer at my master's place...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Her master's house is located at the end of this alley. Years ago, Crownslayer stormed off in a rage to prove that she was strong enough to take revenge on the conspiracies looming over her."
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, Lyudmila has returned once more. Whether or not her efforts have poked a hole through that gloomy sky, she cannot yet say."
    },
    {
        "text": "Possibly, nothing at all has changed. Possibly, she has become an accomplice to an even greater calamity."
    },
    {
        "text": "But luckily, Lyudmila is still able to return to this place. She thinks to herself, surely her teacher will be able to tell her what to do next."
    },
    {
        "text": "At that moment, she suddenly feels a chill."
    },
    {
        "text": "At first, Lyudmila assumes it is because she is nervous about facing her teacher again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "But just as quickly, she realizes that she was wrong."
    },
    {
        "text": "She starts to shake uncontrollably, on the spot."
    },
