    {
        "text": "The thick, inescapable stench of blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her teacher lies face-up on the ground, fresh blood still flowing outward and spreading."
    },
    {
        "text": "A small knife has been dropped nearby."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila tries to approach and stifle her teacher's still-bleeding wound, but she finds herself unable to move a single step, unable to even tear away her gaze."
    },
    {
        "text": "From the shadows wafts an aura that is both familiar and terrifying to her."
    },
    {
        "text": "A wolf with gray hair, wearing a red hoodie."
    },
    {
        "text": "The true wolf is dead. I did as Grandmother asked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
