        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll kill you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm... I promised Kal'tsit to only kill wolves. You are not a wolf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm. Was she your Kal'tsit? That's why you smell of wolf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns",
        "blackstart": 0.15,
        "blackend": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "*gasp*... *gasp*... You know she couldn't fight anymore, so why?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grandmother said. These are the rules of the game.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now, she's out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to go. There are other wolves here. I have to find them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sniffs the air.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_144_red_7#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, another wolf is out of the game. Is someone faster than me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Projekt Red"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1502_crowns",
        "blackstart": 0.15,
        "blackend": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you dare leave!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lyudmila"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The wolf in the red hoodie does not respond to Lyudmila's cries. She hums a fragmented ditty, flitting past Lyudmila with brisk steps."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lyudmila's outstretched hand grasps only thin air."
    },
    {
        "text": "She suddenly remembers what her teacher once told her:"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
