    {
        "text": "A performance worthy of Signorina Caterina! Well worth the wait!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "So we finally know that Cellinia, the ideal Siracusan, was just a fantasy concocted by the collective Siracusan consciousness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "But because she was so well-known by the public as a symbol of perfection, her existence was reasonable enough to explain away through the common imagination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was blown away by the big reveal at the end. She never existed at all!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a profound conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "After the incident with that broadcast a while ago, and everything that followed over the next twelve hours, I thought that was going to be the end of Volsinii.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "But despite all that, here we are enjoying such a fantastic production. Cos\u00ec \u00e8 la vita!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can say that again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew, I thought the sky was going to fall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who would've ever expected things to unfold like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, are you planning to move over to the new city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Depends. But, if Signorina Caterina's plays are still available over in the new city, I could see myself heading over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "A city without famiglie, huh? Growing up, I never even dared to imagine a future like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mention it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you know that Signorina Caterina is working on something completely new?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "A new production?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Excited Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. The title of it alone is enough to get my blood pumping.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's called: 'I Siracusani.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enthusiastic Audience Member"
    },
