    {
        "text": "A shovel digs into the dirt. Then again."
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo is struggling to dig a grave in the cemetery."
    },
    {
        "text": "Next to him is a coffin in which his father, Bernardo, sleeps."
    },
    {
        "text": "Today is the funeral of Bernardo, the former don of Famiglia Bellone."
    },
    {
        "text": "A funeral for one of the Dodici dons should have seen the entire cemetery packed to the fences."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, not a single soul will mourn the passing of a man who betrayed his famiglia, his city, and his society."
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo also asked Lavinia and the others not to come."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is his last farewell to his father."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
