        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Padre mio, how would you be seen by future generations?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "As a man who ushered in a new era, or as a man who betrayed the old one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess that all depends on how well I do, haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've passed one hell of a weight onto my shoulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, I guess that means I'm a worthy son. And that I'm a sucker here to clean up your mess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_shovel",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo continues to chat animatedly as if his father is still alive with him as he digs."
    },
    {
        "text": "But other than that, he doesn't know what else to say."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh right, Signora Sicilia agreed to my request.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There will be no famiglie in the new nomadic city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess a part of your dream did come true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After talking with Signora Sicilia, I think I finally understand her a bit better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seems like she wouldn't mind taking Siracusa with her to the grave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't bother her at all that Siracusa can only enjoy a semblance of peace while she's alive, because for her, Siracusa doesn't need a future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How should I put this...? Signora Sicilia is more like the caretaker of a bygone era than an actual ruler.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reason she was willing to give me a chance was just because she decided it was worth a try. Nothing more, nothing less.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a terrifying being.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... I thought I'd be here all day digging your grave, but it turns out it wasn't so hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough space has been made in the ground to accommodate the coffin. The last thing that remains is to lower it in."
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo walks to the front of the coffin, hesitates for a moment, but finally reaches out his hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "The coffin is extremely heavy, and pushing it is a very demanding task."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as his strength is about to waver, he is suddenly joined by a pair of helping hands."
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo turns his head, and sees Demetri right next to him."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_dragsofa",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "b"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "b",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 15,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Demetri, you...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "33_i07",
        "xScale": 1.05,
        "yScale": 1.05,
        "x": -200,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "duration": 60,
        "xTo": -150,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Demetri says nothing, simply taking an object that shines with a silvery light out from his coat and tossing it into the grave."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a pocket watch."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The Don... he gave it to me.",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And now, I guess it's been returned to its original owner.",
        "x": 400,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "......",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "You've already apologized to me, Leontuzzo.",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "But, even if I can forgive you, our fratelli who died in that conflict could never forgive you.",
        "x": 700,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 400
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Even if Famiglia Bellone is gone, I won't forget them.",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I hear you plan to organize a new famiglia.",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Most of the guys who survived left already, but some stayed behind, and they need a place to go.",
        "x": 700,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 450
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Even for you, that's one ass-backwards famiglia.",
        "x": 450,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "That's how it should be.",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "You're walking down a thorny path.",
        "x": 400,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I know.",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "And eventually, I will stand in your way.",
        "x": 450,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "I know.",
        "x": 250,
        "y": 350,
        "alignment": "left",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "So, don't go dying on me.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "right",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "duration": 5,
        "xTo": 0,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_shallowswalk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "33_i07",
        "xScale": 1.1,
        "yScale": 1.1,
        "x": 150,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "duration": 30,
        "xTo": 200,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The rain continues to come down hard, but Leontuzzo can still faintly hear a soft 'Leon' at the end of that last sentence."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Same to you, Demetri.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "He lifts his head, and lets the raindrops strike his face."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "33_g11_mansionhall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't be needing most of this furniture anymore, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Guess not. Famiglia Bellone is no more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most of the old associates have already left. After all... it's not an easy thing to stomach getting betrayed by your own don.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bernardo, who practically stood on the highest pinnacle of a famiglia's rule, has repudiated the very existence of famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "He also repudiated many things once seen as priceless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honor, trust, loyalty, dedication to the famiglia...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did my father teach each and every wise guy those rules without ever believing in them himself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've been thinking a lot about it, the last few days. Did I ever know the real Bernardo Bellone?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "The artistic director of Compagnia dell'alba was one mask that he wore. The cunning Don Bellone was another.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, is it not possible that the smiling, bright-eyed Bernardo who once shared his ideals with me was just another mask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But, it doesn't matter. Not anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Leon, the two of you, together, gave a chance for that new city to truly be born.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The movers will be here soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "None of this has been in vain, Leon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the new city area... Or, I guess it's a proper city now, we'll build something new.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_427_vigil_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Something brand new, that Siracusa has never seen before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "An order that belongs to everyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Leontuzzo"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leontuzzo looks at Lavinia, his eyes shining with determination."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Civilization.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.5,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
