        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Each wolf, from its moment of birth, knows that its existence is a symbol of the wastelands."
    },
    {
        "text": "After countless eras and countless conflicts, they finally selected the alpha wolf through the rules of the game as it had been played up to that point."
    },
    {
        "text": "For Zaaro, his defeat this round was, undoubtedly, a disgrace."
    },
    {
        "text": "But they will continue to live on."
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as there is another round of the game to be played, he will stage his comeback in time."
    },
    {
        "text": "To this end, he has already started searching for suitable candidates."
    },
    {
        "text": "And almost immediately, he found Lappland, wandering the wastes after having left Volsinii."
    },
    {
        "text": "However\u2014"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#6$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "*pant*... *pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you done napping yet, Zaaro?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_688_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_688_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zaaro"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zaaro and Lappland have been fighting in the wastes for the past three months."
    },
    {
        "text": "During that time, Zaaro had countless opportunities to sink his fangs into the neck of this madwoman."
    },
    {
        "text": "There was no way for her to defeat him."
    },
    {
        "text": "But, he gradually comes to realize, it is actually he who has no way of defeating her."
    },
    {
        "text": "No thought can be nourished in her blood and sinew, no victory can be proclaimed in her head, and no meaning can be derived from her death."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is an empty husk that has been filled."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she also the wastes?"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, she is an overgrowth."
    },
    {
        "text": "He understands in an instant that if Bernardo's betrayal was an unexpected act of rationality, the being before him is completely beyond his comprehension."
    },
    {
        "text": "No, he has seen humans like her before. She is hardly unique."
    },
    {
        "text": "But at this unique point in time, she indeed is the only such one before him."
    },
    {
        "text": "An omen."
    },
    {
        "text": "A summon."
    },
    {
        "text": "And thus, for the first time in thousands of years and perhaps the last time, the incarnation of the wastes lies down next to a human being."
    },
    {
        "text": "He chooses to surrender his dignity to the unknown."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Done fighting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_688_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our battle will continue for thousands upon thousands of years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zaaro"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_688_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the victor is decided, I will walk with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zaaro"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_683_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. Whatever you say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lappland"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Lappland's weapons slip from her grasp. She has already lost consciousness."
    },
    {
        "text": "Before she falls, Zaaro walks over and supports her body with his own, as if it is the most natural thing to do."
    },
